 as the ring arrives and the five-mile tag pins.\",\"24\":\"That means some people could have ankle-deep water in their yard by the time a flash flood warning notification sounds on their phone.\",\"25\":\"acompressor=threshold=0.1259:ratio=3:attack=10:release=160:knee=2.828:makeup=1,loudnorm=I=-15.68:TP=-2.0:LRA=11:linear=false:print_format=json:measured_I=-23.73:measured_TP=-5.38:measured_LRA=14.30:measured_thresh=-35.15:offset=0.94\",\"26\":\"Over the same map a dashed goal pin hovers and does not land. At the empty curb a dashed outline of the station draws itself where one could stand, uninstalled. A deployment goal tag pins beside the dashed pin.\",\"29\":\"On the hub's screen, dots from several stations arrive and a tag names the second, larger model. Shaded flood paths spread out from the first dots along the creek and the low streets. At the desk the dashed higher-risk outlines settle on the screen, a responder's sleeved forearm comes to rest beside it and a for emergency responders tag pins.\",\"31\":\"This on-device AI evaluates current and recent sensor data to predict localized, imminent flood risk without relying on a central server.\",\"32\":\"Campus Life\\nResearch\\nHealth\\nAthletics\\nColleges\\nCarlos Alvarez College of Business\\nCollege of AI, Cyber and Computing\\nCollege of Education and Human Development\\nCollege for Health, Community and Policy\\nCollege of Liberal and Fine Arts\\nCollege of Sciences\\nKlesse College of Engineering and Integrated Design\\nUniversity College\\nHonors College\",\"33\":[{\"id\":\"s5-tags\",\"kind\":\"applicationRecord\",\"props\":{\"label\":\"more than a half mile and up to five miles range tags\"},\"scale\":1,\"x\":540,\"y\":900},{\"id\":\"s5-fivemile\",\"kind\":\"applicationRecord\",\"props\":{\"label\":\"up to five miles in open country tag\"},\"scale\":1,\"x\":540,\"y\":900}],\"35\":\"The field result card stays blank and a none reported stamp presses onto it. Wide on the empty curb after the flood, the p