ponders as they make crucial decisions, such as dispatching crews, closing dangerous roads or issuing targeted neighborhood warnings long before floodwaters peak.\",\"247\":\"07079c7ba2ac11926032acc2ac7b55c2e23e74db86a70a605f88e74d0aea81f0\",\"248\":\"f54137adf7cf5181ff077cb8b9fd85a44131cee44b1fb8139def2f12a088fdfa\",\"249\":\"Run scripts/modern_film.py with --board, --captions, --words, --script and --claims before timed capture and preship. The gate rejects missing or duplicated clauses, omitted qualifiers, stale timing, wrong condition identity, incompatible renderer views and gaps in matching picture coverage. These checks establish bindings, not audience understanding. Code, phone and final reviewers inspect the actual subject and performed action for every clause. Return narration_picture_observations bound to the exact film, with ordered clauses containing id, pass, exact start_s/end_s and observed. Preserve a wrong or absent picture as a source/comprehension blocker even if provider metadata says pass.\",\"25\":\"solar flood station with four optical marks\",\"250\":\"Dots from several stations arrive on the hub dashboard and a tag names the second, larger model. Shaded flood paths spread out from the first dots along the creek and the low streets. Higher-risk zones outline themselves in dashed amber and a for emergency responders tag pins.\",\"251\":\"\\u201cOur ultimate goal is to get this technology deployed where it\\u2019s needed most,\\u201d\",\"252\":\"A clean radio pulse at the antenna that thins as the rings travel outward.\",\"253\":\"01bff5185647039cf6cbefefda605e424cf6cbb35557b198dc3a31e336efd7c0\",\"255\":\"e276842db3d78318df0bc4ee50223a7bf662fb10a13b758f709d3f5c9c6845d7\",\"256\":{\"config/autonomous_completion.json\":\"244d816a1239810909a3add2b78541fb7c6ebb56e84c7611ece2b31a393760e9\",\"config/autonomous_completion_narration_v1.json\":\"76124df1718c1d86481a48c592a4a282e2eb0fdbeb9642626135ff698eb282da\",\"config/source_validation_completion_v1.